        "original_id": "550e4f1d-bcae-5635-9b33-aaa3287ce5b3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Plants: Securinega, Zamioculcas, Zamioculcas zamiifolia\n- Plant families: Phyllanthaceae, Araceae\n- Topics: plant taxonomy, genus description, common names\n\nFacts:\n- Securinega is a genus of plants in the family Phyllanthaceae.\n- Securinega was first described as a genus in 1789.\n- Zamioculcas is a genus of flowering plant in the family Araceae.\n- Zamioculcas contains the single species Zamioculcas zamiifolia.\n- Zamioculcas is commonly called Zanzibar Gem, Zuzu Plant, and Emerald Palm.",
